    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9cbd96ed-dc73-3e96-a5a5-eea4e2fafb29",
                "word": "Bernadette",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6895d7c5-a89c-30c3-86f5-9c2a95cfbe57",
                        "entry_id": "9cbd96ed-dc73-3e96-a5a5-eea4e2fafb29",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name from French."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03c76d8e-9816-4aa8-9f69-ab2af1710634",
                                "sense_id": "6895d7c5-a89c-30c3-86f5-9c2a95cfbe57",
                                "text": "Bernadette Woolley was aware that her name was professionally inappropriate. She tended to get a lot of jokes about it. There had even been recommendations that she change it. The pious connotations put men off, it was averred. Non-Catholics recognised her allegiance at once because of the label, and scorned her for it; while co-religionists, reminded inappropriately of the Virgin apparition at Lourdes, blushed, or sniggered, or asked for another girl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0defcc8f-fa30-4a84-bed1-cd547e9ba08c",
                                "sense_id": "6895d7c5-a89c-30c3-86f5-9c2a95cfbe57",
                                "text": "As they walked farther along the concourse, Bernadette said, \"You call me Bernadette. Aunt won't be necessary. And I don't like Bernie. Or Aunt Bernie or Auntie. For a while, when I was twelve, I wanted everyone to call me Detta. No reason except that I was twelve and trying to fit whatever name sounded more glamorous than Bernadette. I like to be called Bernadette. I've become my name.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a59c6d17-6278-4e01-b3ad-0cd60a09cf58",
                        "source_entry_id": "9cbd96ed-dc73-3e96-a5a5-eea4e2fafb29",
                        "source_sense_id": "6895d7c5-a89c-30c3-86f5-9c2a95cfbe57",
                        "source_sense_description": "female given name",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bernadette",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bernadette",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2db9ec0c-1814-3ef1-bcd4-4abb0b663e76",
                                        "entry_id": "b5c892e2-1b25-3d4c-a1f6-58f195c75ca9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin rendu célèbre par Bernadette Soubirous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82788340-f334-4b63-ab92-db249fb0003b",
                                                "sense_id": "2db9ec0c-1814-3ef1-bcd4-4abb0b663e76",
                                                "text": "Bernadette, elle est très chouette\n Et sa cousine, elle est divine\n Mais son cousin, il est malsain\n Je dirais même que c'est un bon à rien."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0cc3984-f201-44bd-aa2a-972318771748",
                                                "sense_id": "2db9ec0c-1814-3ef1-bcd4-4abb0b663e76",
                                                "text": "L’année suivante, en action de grâces, elle est allée à Lourdes, voyageant toute une nuit dans un train aux banquettes de bois, avec une boîte de sardines pour seule nourriture à cause des restrictions et elle a fait le chemin de croix, à genoux, dans la montagne. Elle m’a rapportée un poupée qui marchait toute seule et qu’on a appelée Bernadette."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "701d519b-963e-452d-bebc-85455da32db9",
                                                "sense_id": "2db9ec0c-1814-3ef1-bcd4-4abb0b663e76",
                                                "text": "Il est aussi derrière deux autres projets d’importance en France : le spectacle multimédia Bernadette et une production qui soulignera le 80e anniversaire du débarquement de Normandie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
